    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On paths untamed by feet before,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The climber ventures to explore,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through magic cliffs, where creatures roam,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To catch the Dreamfin, and bring it home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a cozy 3d precision platformer in which you will be tackling small 3d platforming challenges while interacting with cute characters and completing side quests and minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fishing minigame. Progress across each pond dock by dock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization. Find cute hats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Secrets: Fill the Ice Dragon's treasure wall with treasure throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive soundtrack.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On paths untamed by feet before,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The climber ventures to explore,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through magic cliffs, where creatures roam,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To catch the Dreamfin, and bring it home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a cozy 3d precision platformer in which you will be tackling small 3d platforming challenges while interacting with cute characters and completing side quests and minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fishing minigame. Progress across each pond dock by dock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization. Find cute hats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Secrets: Fill the Ice Dragon's treasure wall with treasure throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive soundtrack.</p>",
